---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.devicerun_v1alpha.DocumentMap Service-specific metadata associated with the operation. It typically contains progress information and common metadata such as create time. Some services might not provide such metadata. Any method that returns a long-running operation should document the metadata type, if any.
